{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016waeBUS1ZJXAB2sKw4quN6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/ratekv/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# ratekv — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 00:21 UTC | 更新原因: Post-MVP: 写完 framing + plan, dream 已提交, 更新 ROADMAP 为 research dashboard 格式\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nPer-KV-head 非均匀 bit-width 分配：通过 constrained MCKP 为每个 KV head 选择最优 bit-width，cardinality constraint 作为 profiler 系统误差的正则化。详见 `paper_framing.md`。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段: Research（Post-MVP）\\\\n\\\\n**MVP 结果**: Constrained MCKP solver PPL=11.23 vs uniform 4-bit 15.45（27% 改善），budget=0.2500 精确匹配，solver 优于手动 oracle (11.23 vs 11.69)。\\\\n\\\\n**投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25, 2026)\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (from paper_framing.md)\\\\n1. Head sensitivity heterogeneity: Layer 0 heads 100× higher delta, 3.6% heads → 70%+ PPL\\\\n2. Constrained MCKP outperforms uniform (27%) and manual oracle\\\\n3. Cardinality constraints = principled regularization for compounding non-additivity\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划 (from experiment_plan.yaml)\\\\n\\\\n### P0 (必跑, ~20 GPU-h, 2-3 天)\\\\n| ID | 描述 | Claim | 模型 |\\\\n|----|------|-------|------|\\\\n| plan_001 | 去掉 L0 排除约束验证 solver 自主性 | 2 | Qwen2.5-7B |\\\\n| plan_002 | Llama-3.1-8B 全 pipeline 复现 | 1,2 | Llama-3.1-8B |\\\\n| plan_003 | Mistral-7B 跨架构验证 | 1,2 | Mistral-7B |\\\\n| plan_004 | Compounding effect 阈值扫描 (max_2bit sweep) | 3 | Qwen2.5-7B |\\\\n| plan_005 | Budget sweep (2×/4×/8× 压缩) | 2 | Qwen2.5-7B |\\\\n| plan_006 | 高分辨率 profiling (64seq×2048tok) | 1,2 | Qwen2.5-7B |\\\\n| plan_007 | C4 跨数据集评估 | 1,2,3 | Qwen2.5-7B |\\\\n\\\\n### P1 (时间允许, ~13 GPU-h)\\\\nplan_008 RateQuant waterfilling baseline | plan_009 Oracle comparison | plan_010 Cross-domain calibration | plan_011 Visualization\\\\n\\\\n### P2 (加分项, ~12 GPU-h)\\\\nplan_012 Downstream tasks | plan_013 70B profiling\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等待 Dream 完成 (dream_20260514T002109) → 验证 framing/plan 是否有结构性问题\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后启动 P0 实验（plan_001-007 尽量并行）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nwestd-37397: 2× RTX PRO 6000 96GB (cuda:0 + cuda:1)\\\\nP0 总需 ~20 GPU-h → 约 2-3 天可完成（双卡并行）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-14 | Corrected RateQuant characterization in paper_fram | plan_008, plan_012, plan_014 |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-14 | Solver auto-discovers L0 sensitivity — plan_001 va | exp_d_no_l0_exclusion, exp_c_constrained_mckp, exp_c_no2bit |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-14 | MVP PASS: constrained MCKP solver PPL=11.23 vs uni | exp_c_constrained_mckp |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-13 | 撤回 D008 Path B; 改为 constrained MCKP: 保留 2-bit 但加 c | exp_b_hires_quant |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-13 | exp_b MIXED: 假设验证(手动24%↑)但solver失败; 采用Path B去掉2-bi | exp_b_hires_quant |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-13 | Pivot: 放弃 eviction arm，转向 PPL-guided per-head bit- | — |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-13 | PPL-guided MCKP 仍然失败：根因是 eviction 的 compounding ef | p0_1_ppl_fast, p0_2_cliff_7B |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 实质 FAIL：attention MSE 被 falsify，pivot 到 chunk- | mvp_004, sanity_004 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-13 | 1.5B sanity 暴露 attention MSE 与 PPL 脱钩；7B 继续跑但需准备 m | sanity_004 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 模型从 Llama 3.1-8B 切换到 Qwen2.5-7B，DuoAttention v | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2822, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Cxbwokq1XMvJjn87kQykrf","session_id":"6cf1809e-9145-4d61-9695-42edadd6799b","uuid":"96287652-f4ac-49a8-9c28-62610f6c1882","timestamp":"2026-05-14T00:56:30.146Z"}
